comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-12T10:47:28.391Z",codex-sol,"Companion epic: pm-cli-website-ox5m. Package-owned implementation and receipts remain in this tracker. No remote writes or releases are authorized."
  "2026-10-12T11:01:19.881Z",codex-sol,"Verified SDK gap in the installed version: PmClient.schemaAddField(name, { type }) drops the type, storing every field as string. Public client.run(schema, { name, options: { subcommand: add-field, fieldType } }) preserves number and boolean types. The package uses that public action and tests numeric PR matching and boolean resolved state with real temp trackers. No upstream issue was filed."
  "2026-10-12T11:20:38.827Z",codex-sol,"Read-only manual CLI acceptance against public unbraind/pm-rl#68 at head 14669bcf58229e7226eed958470babc06c88d570: packed extension installed into a scratch pm project; import created 50 items, updated 0. Round exited 1 as expected: checks pending; CodeRabbit finished true; unresolved threads 0; unvoted bot comments 0; pending imported items 14; unimported nodes 0. Precedents returned 0 before a scratch-only refusal and 1 afterward. Verdict reported applied/replied/reacted/resolved false. No apply or remote mutation ran against the public PR."
  "2026-10-12T11:23:52.481Z",codex-sol,"Coverage passed across all 16 authored executable source/tooling modules: statements 100 percent, branches 100 percent, functions 100 percent, lines 100 percent; 69 tests passed, zero failures/skips/TODOs. The coverage launcher now isolates its raw-data directory explicitly so nested gate tests cannot erase the outer report. Behavioral revert proofs follow in the command feature receipts; every reverted function was restored byte-for-byte before final gates."
  "2026-10-12T11:26:56.321Z",codex-sol,"PM-linked runner acceptance passed node --test test/core.test.ts: 11 tests passed, zero failures or skipped tests, using the host schema sandbox. The sandbox did not override the explicit scratch tracker roots. Default PM test result tracking is disabled, so this comment records the result without changing project test-tracking or telemetry settings."
  "2026-10-12T11:37:32.205Z",codex-sol,"Release gates passed for the unchanged implementation: npm run release:check 11/11 stages, bun run release:check 11/11 stages, and isolated HOME with GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null plus GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check 11/11 stages. Each passed 69/69 unit/behavioral tests and 1/1 packed acceptance test covering npm/npx and native Bun/bunx; zero failures/skips/TODOs. Coverage: statements/lines 1586/1586, functions 83/83, branches 526/526 across 16 source/tooling modules. ESLint clean; duplication zero; 46 declarations documented; production audit zero; tarball 37 files confined to dist, README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, manifest and package.json. Five behavioral revert proofs failed as expected. Isolated strict health passed. No remote writes, repositories, PRs, releases or real apply actions were performed."
